@char Leia.Smile1,ArmR5,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@print つまり私の話は何も間違っていない……<br>ということだね。 { author:Leia speed:1 waitInput:true Wait:true }

@char Ema.Surprised1,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Flushed_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Cry_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
